# ===== SPMKB .gitignore =====
# Proyek ini INTERNAL-ONLY. DILARANG commit data pribadi pekerja.

# --- JANGAN PERNAH commit: data sumber & data runtime (PII pekerja) ---
*.xlsx
*.docx
/data.json
/data.json.bak
/data.json.tmp
/data-src/
# arsip (zip) dapat membawa data.json PII pekerja — jangan pernah commit
*.zip
# PII sumber roster (429 pekerja) — JANGAN PERNAH commit
/data_keanggotaan.csv
# artefak Windows ADS (Zone.Identifier) — metadata, bukan data proyek
*:Zone.Identifier
# lock skill agent (tooling, bukan kode proyek)
skills-lock.json

# --- runtime / environment ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# --- editor / OS ---
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- tool config (agent-specific, not project code) ---
.agents/
.opencode/
knowledge.md
/docs/superpowers/
